  15:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] Comparing to other previous devices, the FLASH interface for STM32F427xx/437xx and
  16:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        STM32F429xx/439xx devices contains the following additional features
  17:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  18:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Capacity up to 2 Mbyte with dual bank architecture supporting read-while-write
  19:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            capability (RWW)
  20:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Dual bank memory organization
  21:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) PCROP protection for all banks
  22:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  23:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
  24:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  25:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure and program the FLASH memory
  26:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        of all STM32F427xx/437xx, STM32F429xx/439xx, STM32F469xx/479xx and STM32F446xx
  27:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        devices. It includes
  28:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory Erase functions:
  29:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and
  30:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
