  31:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Erase function: Erase sector, erase all sectors
  32:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) There are two modes of erase :
  33:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Polling Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase()
  34:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Interrupt Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase_IT()
  35:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  36:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Option Bytes Programming functions: Use HAL_FLASHEx_OBProgram() to :
  37:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set/Reset the write protection
  38:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set the Read protection Level
  39:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set the BOR level
  40:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Program the user Option Bytes
  41:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Advanced Option Bytes Programming functions: Use HAL_FLASHEx_AdvOBProgram() to :
  42:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Extended space (bank 2) erase function
  43:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Full FLASH space (2 Mo) erase (bank 1 and bank 2)
  44:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Dual Boot activation
  45:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Write protection configuration for bank 2
